        H --> I["Proposed evaluation: overall and group-level errors"]
    end
    C -.-> D
    classDef documented fill:#e6f3f1,stroke:#21666a,color:#183b3b
    classDef planned fill:#f2f4f7,stroke:#6b7280,color:#26313d
